  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0-beta.1 Prerelease. Bundles apex-grid 4.0.0-beta.2 (was 3.6.0). New: opt-in Ignite UI theming, turned on once with ApexGridIgniteUI.Enable(); per grid, DesignSystem=\"false\" turns the Ignite UI colours and font off and Tokens=\"false\" turns off the family --apx-* tokens too. Behaviour to note: an Ignite UI stylesheet on the page no longer re-tints the grid brand or replaces its font until ApexGridIgniteUI.Enable() is called; body rows are recycled on scroll, sort and filter; the grid role and row counts moved from the apex-grid host to its inner table part; with pagination, pinned rows no longer count toward the pages.",
